---
// Footer.astro - CCログ超訳 Footer Component
const appVersion = __APP_VERSION__;
---

<footer class='mt-24'>
  <div class='max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12'>
    <!-- AI生成コンテンツの注意書き -->
    <div
      class='mb-10 p-5 bg-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange)/0.04)] border-l-4 border-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] rounded-r-xl'
    >
      <p class='text-sm font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black))] mb-1'>
        AI生成コンテンツについて
      </p>
      <p class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] leading-relaxed'>
        ページの概要(サマリー)、変更内容の日本語訳、ユーザーへの恩恵の解説はAIによって生成されているため、誤っている可能性があります。正確な情報は
        <a
          href='https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases'
          target='_blank'
          rel='noopener noreferrer'
          class='text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-orange-hover))] underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors'
        >
          公式リリースノート
        </a>
        をご確認ください。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- リンクセクション -->
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:gap-12 mb-10'>
      <div>
        <p
          class='text-xs font-bold text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.4)] mb-4 tracking-widest uppercase'
        >
          リソース
        </p>
        <ul class='space-y-3'>
          <li>
            <a
              href='https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code'
              target='_blank'
              rel='noopener noreferrer'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='currentColor'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule='evenodd'
                  d='M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z'
                  clip-rule='evenodd'></path>
              </svg>
              Claude Code GitHub
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='https://code.claude.com/docs'
              target='_blank'
              rel='noopener noreferrer'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z'
                ></path>
              </svg>
              公式ドキュメント
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='/'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M4 6h16M4 10h16M4 14h16M4 18h16'></path>
              </svg>
              バージョンの変更履歴
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='/features'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M3.75 6A2.25 2.25 0 016 3.75h2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0110.5 6v2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM3.75 15.75A2.25 2.25 0 016 13.5h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 013.75 18v-2.25zM13.5 6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18A2.25 2.25 0 0120.25 6v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 10.5h-2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM13.5 15.75a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0118 20.25h-2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0113.5 18v-2.25z'
                ></path>
              </svg>
              機能エリア別の変更履歴
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='/docs'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 13.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 0 0-9-9Z'
                ></path>
              </svg>
              公式ドキュメント更新履歴
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='/rss.xml'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M6 5c7.18 0 13 5.82 13 13M6 11a7 7 0 017 7m-6 0a1 1 0 110-2 1 1 0 010 2z'
                ></path>
              </svg>
              RSSフィード
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p
          class='text-xs font-bold text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.4)] mb-4 tracking-widest uppercase'
        >
          プロジェクト
        </p>
        <ul class='space-y-3'>
          <li>
            <a
              href='https://github.com/Suntory-N-Water/claude-code-changelog-viewer'
              target='_blank'
              rel='noopener noreferrer'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='currentColor'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule='evenodd'
                  d='M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z'
                  clip-rule='evenodd'></path>
              </svg>
              GitHubリポジトリ
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='/notify'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9'
                ></path>
              </svg>
              通知設定
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='/about'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z'
                >
                </path>
              </svg>
              このサイトについて
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='/contact'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z'
                >
                </path>
              </svg>
              お問い合わせ
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='/privacy'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2.5'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-4 h-4'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z'
                >
                </path>
              </svg>
              プライバシーポリシー
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- フッターボトム -->
    <div
      class='pt-6 border-t border-[hsl(var(--cc-gray))] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2'
    >
      <p class='text-xs text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.4)]'>
        非公式プロジェクト。AnthropicおよびClaudeはAnthropic, PBCの商標です。
      </p>
      <span
        class='text-xs text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.3)]'
        style='font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;'
      >
        v{appVersion}
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
